get.description:
Stream real-time workflow execution events via Server-Sent Events (SSE).

This endpoint subscribes to Redis pub/sub channel for the given run_id
and streams node-level updates and run completion events to the client.

Events include:
- Node updates: {run_id, workflow_id, node_id, status, output}
- Run completion: {run_id, workflow_id, event_type: "run_complete", status, outputs}

Args:
    workflow_id: UUID of the workflow
    run_id: UUID of the workflow run to stream events for
    request: FastAPI request object for detecting client disconnects

Returns:
    StreamingResponse with text/event-stream content type

Example frontend usage:
    const eventSource = new EventSource('/workflows/{workflow_id}/runs/{run_id}/events');
    eventSource.onmessage = (event) => {
        const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
        if (data.event_type === 'run_complete') {
            eventSource.close();
        }
    };
